  "body": "Seen in the quick gate of PR #2773 on 2026-11-21 (Windows, 1040 steps, 18 jobs): the app test `mcp_live::a_client_that_keeps_talking_is_never_dropped_as_idle` failed with `ConnectionReset` (os error 10054). The PR does not touch MCP code. The test passed 3 of 3 times when it ran alone.\n\nProbable cause: a timing budget or a socket timeout that is too tight when the machine runs many test steps at the same time.\n\nWork:\n1. Find the timeout or the idle limit that the test depends on.\n2. Make the test independent of machine load (a limit scaled to the work, or a retry with a stated bound), without weakening what it checks: a client that keeps talking is never dropped as idle.\n",
